[{"title":"雨晴渡关二首 其二","author":"宗泽","text":"荡涤真成快，氛霾不敢阴。\n万花恩泽了，二麦宠光深。\n地势瞻仙掌，河源识帝心。\n马头迎霁色，诗句日边寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26601,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨晴渡关二首 其一","author":"宗泽","text":"燕北静胡尘，河南濯我兵。\n风云朝会合，天地昼清明。\n泣涕收横溃，焦枯赖发生。\n不辞关路远，辛苦向都城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26602,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道逢乡人笑仆驺马之瘦","author":"宗泽","text":"生笑长裾曳，仍羞下泽奔。\n据鞍非马援，叱驭岂王尊。\n汗血能观国，的卢终感恩。\n莫欺驺马瘦，挥策诸金门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26603,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东上辞松楸一首","author":"宗泽","text":"八年坐亲党，泯伏长安城。\n甘心傍松楸，申我儿子情。\n闭户慨岩廊，读书笑金籯。\n力田固为政，课童乃司兵。\n深病骨相寒，不蒙轩冕荣。\n维天临万邦，搜罗世豪英。\n我友挽出之，大人今继明。\n古无忠孝全，泣涕去丘茔。\n为翁大门闾，翻然以东征。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26604,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒华岳","author":"宗泽","text":"杨赐岳所挺，严武金天晶。\n二子为时出，顾我非炳灵。\n维岳镇四方，气秀天骨青。\n巀嶭立千仞，力能产公卿。\n降神咏崧高，谶纬仍反经。\n取象到执圭，谲怪如洞冥。\n平生笑穷奇，立语心自惊。\n我质培塿耳，胸中固峥嵘。\n谁言华岳高，我山摩玉京。\n是中所包藏，丹碧参瑰琼。\n平居蛰云雷，飞雨溢四溟。\n此岂真有之，落笔纷纵横。\n发我文物秘，象渠膏泽倾。\n太华屹不摇，我山身载行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26605,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渭南道中逢二蜀兵出印本手诏司马温公范文正公赠太师外祖丞相赠太保悲喜交集慨然赋诗","author":"宗泽","text":"我君肇当阳，憸佞毕退听。\n示民以好恶，观此第一政。\n恭惟司马范，二老文且正。\n堂堂外王父，九牧称无尽。\n宸章粲褒贲，倬彼云汉盛。\n昭回天下来，光生万象俊。\n小臣行抱忧，中路得此庆。\n慨然夷望归，欣闻比干赠。\n伤心外王父，三黜坐谏争。\n未为召公保，亟上丞相印。\n群邪肆欺诬，不死仗元圣。\n阉童裂茅土，儇子执魁柄。\n十载卧江湖，赍志目不瞑。\n谁言堕黄壤，庙象饰绣衮。\n石椁安用营，金縢渠不信。\n因知日月星，虽晦终不泯。\n一旦遇雷风，浮云岂能病。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26606,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道逢散遣之卒云讲和退师无所用之矣辄以二十六句道胸臆","author":"宗泽","text":"翁拥麾幢我为儿，剽闻窃睹皆兵机。\n其中袭击不容瞬，飙行电掣犹逶迤。\n戎人长驱越大河，天下震惊观阙危。\n肉食之谋殊未臧，我愤切骨其谁知。\n慨然奏疏金马门，力陈盟赂损国威。\n严尤下策尤可笑，晁错上书亦奚为。\n道路荆棘初剪除，花如步障吾东之。\n八年闭户尺蠖屈，一旦渡关匹马驰。\n行行侧身听戎捷，忽闻募士诏遣归。\n浓书大墨榜教诏，曰敌悔过今退师。\n羽檄向来召貔虎，乃咏出车歌杕杜。\n櫜兵销刃兵犹怒，却把锄犁农歌舞。\n君王神武今艺祖，尔如不归污我斧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26607,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感时","author":"宗泽","text":"卿士辱多垒，天王愤蒙尘。\n御戎要虓将，谋国须隽臣。\n百战取封侯，未必亡其身。\n怀奸废忠义，胡颜以为人。\n吁嗟世道衰，大僇加搢绅。\n平居事奔竞，梁汴分云屯。\n一旦国步艰，四迸如星繁。\n辅相已择栖，守令仍踰藩。\n冠盖陆西窜，舳舻水南奔。\n鄙夫用慨然，策马趋修门。\n勤王羞尺柄，悟主期片言。\n时来倘云龙，峨冠拜临轩。\n逶迤上玉除，造膝伸元元。\n措世于泰宁，归来守丘樊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26608,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题独乐园","author":"宗泽","text":"范公之乐后天下，维师温公乃独乐。\n二老致意出处间，殊涂同归两不恶。\n鄙夫杖藜访公隐，步无石砌登无阁。\n堂卑不受有美夺，地僻宁遭景华拓。\n始知前辈稽古力，晏子萧何非妄作。\n细读隶碑增慷慨，端正似之甘再拜。\n种药作畦医国手，浇花成林膏泽大。\n见山台上飞嵩高，高山仰止如公在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26609,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠鸡山陈七四秀才","author":"宗泽","text":"渥洼生骏驹，丹山生凤雏。\n家有宁馨子，庆自积善馀。\n粹然秀眉宇，瑩彻真璠玙。\n高声诵论语，健腕学大书。\n头头欲第一，气已淩空虚。\n想其顾复意，何止掌上珠。\n更期速腾达，尔祖立以须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26610,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卢行者偈","author":"宗泽","text":"休问东西南北，莫说之乎者也。\n直饶神秀文□，不似老卢行者。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26611,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旧作感怀","author":"宗泽","text":"关中黄壤黑壤，大是邦家利源。\n古者亩收十一，谁兴岁取十千。\n不用府无虚月，藏之斯民裕然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26612,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"述怀二首 其二","author":"宗泽","text":"黄屋肇新巍巍，四方豪杰云来。\n片言之误天也，一见而决时哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26613,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"述怀二首 其一","author":"宗泽","text":"忧国心如奔马，勤王笔有奇兵。\n一旦立诛祸乱，千载坐视太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26614,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵园 其二","author":"宗泽","text":"凿池智有泉源，种木胸无芥蒂。\n螭头吐水涓涓，端是银潢一派。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26615,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵园 其一","author":"宗泽","text":"瑶瑛夹侍梅台，琴瑟自鸣松岛。\n山中野服相羊，足以亡忧遣老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26616,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天衣故寺","author":"宗瑩","text":"园庙深关春寂寂，雨杉风桧翠萧萧。\n山中旧事无人说，碎叠唐碑补石桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26617,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"宗提刑","text":"龙田亦有耕痕在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26618,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳梢青","author":"宝月","text":"脉脉春心，情人渐远，难托离愁。\n雨后寒轻，风前香软，春在梨花。\n行人倚棹天涯。\n酒醒处、残阳乱鸦。\n门外秋千，墙头红粉，深院谁家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26619,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜双双/惜分飞","author":"宝月","text":"庚岭香前亲写得。\n子细看、粉匀无迹。\n月殿休寻觅。\n姑射人来，知是曾相识。\n不要青春闲用力。\n也会寄、江南信息。\n著意应难摘。\n留与梨花，此并真颜色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26620,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"宝祐士人","text":"空使蜀人思董永，恨无汉剑斩丁公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26621,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题雉山","author":"尚用之","text":"座下闻经本至诚，改头易面悟前身。\n信知大道无难事，一念真如雉化人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26622,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依杨益老韵赋曾公岩","author":"尚用之","text":"当暑都忘畏赫曦，游观邂逅得心期。\n咸其自尔从天造，贲以人为特地奇。\n风露乍凉秋至后，林峦散影月明时。\n朱轓好事留佳客，大醉高岩许镇随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26623,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张洵蒙亭诗韵","author":"尚用之","text":"江亭胜既冠三湘，仁智所乐皆其旁。\n翠岫俯映青罗光，上月乔木摩穹苍。\n亭下川遐覆银塘，水面风来笑语香。\n骚人相值喜飞觚，雄辩清谈五月凉。\n饮馀相与坐方床，论文日暮兴何长。\n佳篇疾读韵琅琅，直疑星斗焕光芒。\n格高调古说奇方，况复笔法追二王。\n事业无穷叹茫茫，丹铅点勘策非郎。\n与公致道心可忘，浩歌直造无何乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26624,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游澹山岩 其二","author":"尚用之","text":"岩深树绿春长在，岩暝雨霁云初归。\n天爱护持有神物，蛇去因果无狐疑。\n石田药臼谁与刻，香山乳窦苔生衣。\n未问城南阆州比，此景自是寰中稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26625,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游澹山岩 其一","author":"尚用之","text":"我来训狐无所闻，老人戏我不动尘。\n道愧未尝分寸得，心灰要似寻常人。\n断崖危绊藤蔓古，残僧静对桃李春。\n次山不遇过山谷，倬□妙句垂坚珉。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26626,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州翠微亭","author":"岳飞","text":"经年尘土满征衣，特特寻芳上翠微。\n好山好水看不足，马蹄催趁月明归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26627,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过张溪赠张完","author":"岳飞","text":"无心买酒谒青春，对镜空嗟白发新。\n花下少年应笑我，垂垂羸马访高人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26628,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题青泥市萧寺壁","author":"岳飞","text":"雄气堂堂贯斗牛，誓将直节报君雠。\n斩除顽恶还车驾，不问登坛万户侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26629,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题雩都华严寺","author":"岳飞","text":"手持竹节访黄龙，旧穴空遗虎子踪。\n云锁断崖无觅处，半山松竹撼秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26630,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从驾游内苑应制","author":"岳飞","text":"敕报游西内，春光霭上林。\n花围千朵锦，柳撚万株金。\n燕绕龙旂舞，莺随凤辇吟。\n君王多雨露，化育一人心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26631,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归赴行在过上竺寺偶题","author":"岳飞","text":"强胡犯金阙，驻跸大江南。\n二帝双魂杳，孤臣百战酣。\n兵威空朔漠，法力仗瞿昙。\n恢复山河日，捐躯分亦甘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26632,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送轸上人之庐山","author":"岳飞","text":"何处高人云路迷，相逢忽荐目前机。\n偶看菜叶随流水，知有茅茨在翠微。\n琐细夜谈皆可听，烟霏秋雨欲同归。\n翛然又向诸方去，无数山供玉麈挥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26633,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送紫岩张先生北伐","author":"岳飞","text":"号令风霆迅，天声动北陬。\n长驱渡河洛，直捣向燕幽。\n马蹀阏氏血，旗枭克汗头。\n归来报明主，恢复旧神州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26634,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄浮图慧海","author":"岳飞","text":"湓浦庐山几度秋，长江万折向东流。\n男儿立志扶王室，圣主专师灭虏酋。\n功业要刊燕石上，归休终伴赤松游。\n丁宁寄语东林老，莲社从此著力修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26635,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游嵬石山寺","author":"岳飞","text":"嵬石山前寺，林泉胜景幽。\n紫金诸佛相，白雪老僧头。\n潭水寒生月，松风夜带秋。\n我来属龙语，为雨济民忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26636,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题池州翠光寺","author":"岳飞","text":"爱此倚栏杆，谁同寓目閒。\n轻阴弄晴日，秀色隐空山。\n岛树萧疏外，征帆杳霭间。\n予虽江上老，心羡白云还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26637,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题翠岩寺","author":"岳飞","text":"秋风江上驻王师，暂向云山蹑翠微。\n忠义必期清塞水，功名直欲镇边圻。\n山林啸聚何劳取，沙漠群凶定破机。\n行复三关迎二圣，金酋席卷尽擒归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26638,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题骤马冈","author":"岳飞","text":"立马林冈豁战眸，阵云开处一溪流。\n机舂水沚犹传晋，黍秀宫庭孰悯周。\n南服只今歼小丑，北辕何日返神州。\n誓将七尺酬明圣，怒指天涯泪不收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26639,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小重山","author":"岳飞","text":"昨夜寒蛩不住鸣。\n惊回千里梦、已三更。\n起来独自绕阶行。\n人悄悄、帘外月胧明。\n白首为功名。\n旧山松竹老、阻归程。\n欲将心事付瑶琴。\n知音少、弦断有谁听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26640,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"岳飞","text":"怒发冲冠，凭阑处、潇潇雨歇。\n抬望眼、仰天长啸，壮怀激烈。\n三十功名尘与土，八千里路云和月。\n莫等閒、白了少年头，空悲切。\n靖康耻，犹未雪。\n臣子恨，何时灭。\n驾长车踏破，贺兰山缺。\n壮志饥餐胡虏肉，笑谈渴饮匈奴血。\n待从头、收拾旧山河，朝天阙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26641,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 其二 登黄鹤楼有感","author":"岳飞","text":"遥望中原，荒烟外、许多城郭。\n想当年、花遮柳护，凤楼龙阁。\n万岁山前珠翠绕，蓬壶殿里笙歌作。\n到而今、铁蹄满郊畿，风尘恶。\n兵安在，膏锋锷。\n民安在，填沟壑。\n叹江山如故，千村寥落。\n何日请缨提锐旅，一鞭直渡清河洛。\n却归来、再续汉阳游，骑黄鹤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26642,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凌丹亭","author":"岳甫","text":"石门莎径绿回环，月挂虚檐滴露寒。\n自有松风时度曲，我琴高挂不须弹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26643,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巾山晓望","author":"岳甫","text":"角逐东来几巨鳌，化为奠位两山高。\n江枫作意红千叠，野水何心绿一遭。\n露洗松巅沈晓籁，霜明天际察秋毫。\n会须竹院求馀地，岁晚安閒读楚骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26644,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头","author":"岳甫","text":"鲁口天下壮，襟楚带三吴。\n山川表里营垒，屯列拱神都。\n鹦鹉洲前处士，黄鹤楼中仙客，拍手试招呼。\n莫诵昔人句，不食武昌鱼。\n望樊冈，过赤壁，想雄图。\n寂寥霸气，应笑当日阿瞒疏。\n收拾周黄策略，成就孙刘基业，未信赏音无。\n我醉君起舞，明日隔江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26645,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 甫敬赋满江红，敬祝百千遐算，甫再拜","author":"岳甫","text":"碧海迢遥，曾窥见、赤城楼堞。\n因傲睨尘寰，犹带凭虚仙骨。\n武库胸中兵十万，文场笔阵诗千百。\n记向来、小试听胪传，居前列。\n世间事，都未说。\n亲为大，官毫末。\n况诸郎钟庆，夙龄英发。\n银菟颁符方易地，金銮寓直行趋阙。\n更相期、尽节早归来，传丹诀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26646,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月八日桐川道中二绝 其一","author":"岳珂","text":"断云轻素抹山腰，山下人家野水桥。\n小队旌旗空猎猎，不教閒趁酒旗招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26647,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月八日桐川道中二绝 其二","author":"岳珂","text":"依稀九日明朝是，三径情知不到家。\n随分秋光关节物，桐川道上看黄花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26648,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东坝以里沿岸人家皆对门植苇于小屿不晓其旨漫成四绝 其二","author":"岳珂","text":"万里江滨长野芦，西风元不费工夫。\n两京荠菜论斤卖，耳目由来喜所无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26649,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东坝以里沿岸人家皆对门植苇于小屿不晓其旨漫成四绝 其四","author":"岳珂","text":"曲江西畔锁离宫，细柳新蒲日日风。\n想见千门映春绿，君王未见碧成丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26650,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东坝以里沿岸人家皆对门植苇于小屿不晓其旨漫成四绝 其一","author":"岳珂","text":"岸傍几曲住人家，浅屿排门种荻花。\n纵使秋声常索索，断无司马听琵琶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26651,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东坝以里沿岸人家皆对门植苇于小屿不晓其旨漫成四绝 其三","author":"岳珂","text":"北都旧产无淇竹，见说园池芦苇多。\n涨绿不妨夜来雨，更须别浦听鸣荷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26652,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"右军初月帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"唐摹之传取奇古，彷佛硬黄疑此楮。\n我从眼力别瑶珷，安得庸奴字如许。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26653,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兴唐寺闻钟","author":"岳珂","text":"兴唐钟刻无夫字，久欲摩挲与细论。\n归棹未容酬此志，一声烟霭又黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26654,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其四","author":"岳珂","text":"拥骑年时忆往来，旧时行处半莓苔。\n山云勒驾应频笑，又是江南勾当回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26655,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其七","author":"岳珂","text":"湓波已近见康庐，风月烟云自卷舒。\n白鸟归来閒似我，向山深处认巢居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26656,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其三","author":"岳珂","text":"指点神鸦送客樯，江山回首郁苍苍。\n吴朝千载兴亡地，极目长淮恨更长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26657,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其九","author":"岳珂","text":"西望沙羡东秣陵，湓江中道是归程。\n柳阴系缆人归后，频有黄鹂三四声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26658,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其一","author":"岳珂","text":"日日征帆上水风，掀天雪浪骇鱼龙。\n不须检校江行历，知过云山几万重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26659,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其十","author":"岳珂","text":"人生最好是归来，六月火云溶雪醅。\n散发晞风须一醉，月明携簟又凉台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26660,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其八","author":"岳珂","text":"官牌夹外少人烟，商妇琵琶久断弦。\n司马青衫不须泣，江鸥对我正忻然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26661,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其二","author":"岳珂","text":"远村烟暝牛羊下，近岸波澄鸥鹭閒。\n一抹斜阳江似镜，天移小景向人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26662,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其五","author":"岳珂","text":"夕舂正是隔前溪，江路行人犹未归。\n我笑卧龙成底事，晨光尽欠踏熹微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后江行十绝 其六","author":"岳珂","text":"叫着渔郎急掉头，一声别浦听莲讴。\n山遥水远应同趣，我亦青帘问酒楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"米元章姑孰诗帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"天上文章一酒星，生平只欠换鹅经。\n奇才逸思通千古，留待南宫眼为青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]